      "id": "2122183759382589675",
      "text": "Maurice on Matthew Tkachuk: “He's at his best now. This is the best year of hockey I've seen him play. He's been highly consistent, really engaged in the game, helping his teammates. He just keeps getting better for us.”",
      "url": "https://x.com/darraghfla/status/2122183759382589675",
      "published": "2026-11-16T04:23:31+00:00",
      "likes": 72,
      "author": "Rob Darragh",
      "handle": "darraghfla",
