      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122183026557792332",
      "text": "Hathaway: “You look back when we were all younger, and we have this dream of playing in the NHL. We get the support of our parents. They're the ones waking up early, driving us to games, long road trips, and you're sleeping in the passenger seats.”",
      "url": "https://x.com/darraghfla/status/2122183026557792332",
      "published": "2026-11-16T04:20:36+00:00",
      "likes": 26,
      "author": "Rob Darragh",
      "handle": "darraghfla",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1877918869299302400/mZrlGMtT_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122182327174328424",
      "text": "Hathaway: “They're the role models that tell you to dream.”",
      "url": "https://x.com/darraghfla/status/2122182327174328424",
      "published": "2026-11-16T04:17:49+00:00",
      "likes": 13,
      "author": "Rob Darragh",
      "handle": "darraghfla",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1877918869299302400/mZrlGMtT_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
